{"sections":[{"slug":"Verma模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Verma模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Verma 模”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>#<span lang=\"zh\">几何表示论</span></p>\n<p>Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是最大的以</span> $\\lambda\\in\\mathfrak h^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">为最高权的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/最高权模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大权模</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中比较</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">简单</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">注意到正则表示不属于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":".)</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">权</span> $\\lambda\\in\\mathfrak h^*$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一维表示</span> $\\mathbb{C}_\\lambda$. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑短正合列</span> $0 \\to \\mathfrak n \\to \\mathfrak b \\overset{\\pi}{\\to} \\mathfrak h \\to 0$, (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子代数","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathfrak b$ <span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $\\mathbb{C}_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">可通过</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">视为</span> $\\mathfrak b$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">为这个</span> $\\mathfrak b$-<span lang=\"zh\">表示沿</span> $\\mathfrak b\\hookrightarrow\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的推前</span>\n$$\r\nM_\\lambda = \\mathcal U\\mathfrak g \\otimes_{\\mathcal U\\mathfrak b} \\mathbb{C}_\\lambda.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是由一个最高权向量</span> $v$ (<span lang=\"zh\">即上述张量积定义中的</span> $1\\otimes 1$) <span lang=\"zh\">根据关系</span> $hv=\\lambda(h)v$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成的</span> $\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另一个等价的定义是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $I_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $h-\\lambda (h)$ ($h\\in\\mathfrak h$) <span lang=\"zh\">以及所有正根生成的</span> $\\mathcal U\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的左理想</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nM_\\lambda = \\mathcal U_{\\mathfrak g} / I_\\lambda.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极大权模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大权模</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">都是某个</span> Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模的商</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">故</span> Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模又称泛极大权模</span>.</p>\n<p>Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/特征","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">形式特征</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\frac{e^{\\lambda}}{\\prod_{\\alpha\\in R^+}(1-e^{-\\alpha})}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $R^+$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示正</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的集合</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">唯一的不可约商</span></h3>\n<p>Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个唯一的不可约商</span> $L_\\lambda$. <span lang=\"zh\">这是因为</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">任何真子模</span> $N\\hookrightarrow M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的权都不可能包含</span> $\\lambda$, <span lang=\"zh\">所以存在最大的真子模</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即所有真子模的并</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">张成的子模</span>).</p>\n<p>$L_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">中所有的不可约对象</span>.</p>\n<h3>Jordan–Holder <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span></h3>\n<p>Verma <span lang=\"zh\">模具有</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Jordan–Holder分解","text":"Jordan–Holder <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">事实上</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴O","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> O"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">的对象均为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Artin对象","text":"Artin <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">人们想要计算</span> $[M_\\lambda : L_\\mu]$. "},{"Local":{"url":"/BGG定理","text":"BGG <span lang=\"zh\">定理</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出了</span> $[M_\\lambda : L_\\mu]\\neq 0$ <span lang=\"zh\">的条件</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">另见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kazhdan–Lusztig猜想","text":"Kazhdan–Lusztig <span lang=\"zh\">猜想</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}